#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "420"
msgid "Quit"
msgstr "Salir"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=dani64amv
msgctxt "425"
msgid "Cancel the order."
msgstr "Cancelar el pedido."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=dani64amv
msgctxt "443"
msgid "Order"
msgstr "Pagar"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "449"
msgid "Order the currently selected item.  "
msgstr "Pedir el objeto actualmente seleccionado.  "

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=dani64amv
#. y4:reviewed_by=dani64amv
msgctxt "486"
msgid "(I haven't picked anything.)  "
msgstr "(No he escogido nada)."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:translated_by=dani64amv
#. y4:reviewed_by=dani64amv
msgctxt "517"
msgid "(I'm short on cash.)  "
msgstr "(Me hace falta dinero)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "540"
msgid "Thank you. That'll be %s."
msgstr "Gracias. Eso sería %s."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=dani64amv
msgctxt "566"
msgid "(I can't carry any more stuff.)"
msgstr "(No puedo llevar más cosas)."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=dani64amv
msgctxt "598"
msgid "(They're sold out.)"
msgstr "(Están agotados)."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "618"
msgid "This'll make you popular with the ladies, I guarantee\nit."
msgstr "Esto te hará popular entre las damas, te lo garantizo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "676"
msgid "Rumored to bring good luck to its wearer. I vouch for\nit myself."
msgstr "Se rumorea que trae buena suerte a quien lo lleva puesto.\nYo mismo lo confirmo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "741"
msgid "I got this from a guy with money problems for next to\nnothing, so I'll sell it for cheap."
msgstr "Lo conseguí de un tipo con problemas económicos por\ncasi nada, así que lo venderé barato."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "831"
msgid "This is a tiger skin belt. It's real tiger leather, and \nsome say it provides mystical protection."
msgstr "Este es un cinturón de piel de tigre. Es auténtica\npiel de tigre y se dice que proporciona protección\nmística."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "930"
msgid "The irregular shape of this pearl makes it less\nvaluable than round ones, but some people prefer\nthem."
msgstr "La forma irregular de esta perla la hace menos\nvaliosa que las redondas, pero a algunas personas\nles gusta más."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1033"
msgid "You like this 9-iron? It's not part of a set, but it's still\ngood for swinging around."
msgstr "¿Te gusta este hierro 9? No es parte de un set completo,\npero aun así es bueno para balancearlo."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1120"
msgid "Ah, the bat. You'd be surprised how many foreigners\nbring those in. Great for sandlot games."
msgstr "Ah, el bate. Te sorprendería la cantidad de extranjeros\nque los traen. Son geniales para los juegos informales\nen los terrenos baldíos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1213"
msgid "This Chinese broadsword is a legendary weapon from\nChina. It's light, but don't go swinging it around here!"
msgstr "Este Sable Chino es un arma legendaria de China.\nEs liviana, ¡pero no vayas a agitarla por aquí!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1321"
msgid "This is an heirloom from the Lotus Clan, a famed \nChinese warrior family."
msgstr "Este es un objeto heredado del Clan Loto, una\nfamosa familia de guerreros chinos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1395"
msgid "Made from wood even harder than red oak. I'm sure \ngetting hit with it would hurt, so be careful with it."
msgstr "Hecho de madera aún más dura que la encina roja.\nEstoy seguro de que recibir un golpe con esto dolería,\nasí que ten cuidado con él."

